<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ICI in PVC venture with Auseon.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ICI in PVC venture with Auseon.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICI Australia Ltd said on Wednesday it would combine its domestic vinyl and PVC business with Auseon to form a new joint venture.</p>
<p>Auseon is wholly owned by Geon Co of the U.S.</p>
</text>
